{"id":"8f281c2661652f22","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Way Below Relation","display":"df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation — ZFC Order12 Way Below Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation","58-df-zfc-order9-way-below-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation — ZFC Order12 Way Below Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-order9-way-below-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation — ZFC Order12 Way Below Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9611c23f91c8d5e4\" href=\"?note=9611c23f91c8d5e4\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (ordered set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(R\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (way-below relation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S\\)</span> (directed-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9611c23f91c8d5e4\" href=\"?note=9611c23f91c8d5e4\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WayBelowRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WayBelowRelation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}way\\text{-}below\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WayBelowRelation}_S(R,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land R\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Ps)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Pu))\\to s\\leq_Pu)\\land y\\leq_Ps\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(x\\leq_Pd)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}way\\text{-}below\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WayBelowRelation}_S(R,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land R\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Ps)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Pu))\\to s\\leq_Pu)\\land y\\leq_Ps\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(x\\leq_Pd)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directed suprema are expressed by their least-upper-bound property rather than by an undeclared choice operator.</li>\n<li>The order9 way-below-relation variant is an alias for membership in this relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9611c23f91c8d5e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Order}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"9611c23f91c8d5e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S$ (directed-poset predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Order}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WayBelowRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}way\\text{-}below\\text{-}relation}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WayBelowRelation}_S(R,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land R\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\Bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_P\\cap(D\\times D))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Ps)\n\\land\\forall u\\in P\\;((\\forall d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_Pu))\\to s\\leq_Pu)\\land y\\leq_Ps\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{30mm}\\to\\exists d\\in D\\;(x\\leq_Pd)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1675,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2924","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation.md|58-df-zfc-order12-way-below-relation]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9611c23f91c8d5e4","2aa29158e60b337f"]}